### Quick Tips for Visiting

| Tip | Why It Matters |
|-----|----------------|
| **Book in advance** | Especially for the Anne Frank House and Van Gogh Museum, tickets often sell out. |
| **Combine tickets** | Many museums offer a combined pass that saves money and time. |
| **Check opening hours** | Some museums close on certain days (e.g., the Rijksmuseum is closed on Mondays). |
| **Plan your route** | These museums are all within walking distance of each other in the Museumplein area, so you can hop from one to the next. |

